{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12439","headline":"寻司勳李郎中不遇 · 钱起","name":"寻司勳李郎中不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知己知音同舍郎，如何咫尺阻清扬。\n每恨蒹葭傍芳树，多惭新燕入华堂。\n重花不隔陈蕃榻，修竹能深夫子墙。\n唯有早朝趋凤合，朝时怜羽接鸳行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}